      en: ["The relief includes significant parts of the Western and Eastern Carpathians.", "Gerlachovský štít is the highest peak in the system at 2,655 meters.", "The geology features a mix of granite, limestone, and volcanic rocks.", "It contains major national parks including the High Tatras and Pieniny.", "The mountain ranges were formed primarily during the Alpine orogeny.", "Deep valleys like the Váh and Hron separate the individual belts."],
